      "content": "Issue SQL queries against Firebolt engines and manage account/engine resources. Authentication is OAuth 2.0 client_credentials against https://id.app.firebolt.io/oauth/token (audience https://api.firebolt.io). The returned bearer token is used on subsequent requests against api.app.firebolt.io and individual engine URLs.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Firebolt",
